# Test fetching ESPN details for an Arsenal match (401879301 is Arsenal vs Coventry)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/401879301/scrape-espn?league=eng.1

###
# Test fetching Understat details for Arsenal vs someone (say match 26498)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/401879301/scrape-understat?understatMatchId=26498

###
# Get details
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/401879301/details

###
# Get shotmap
GET http://localhost:8080/api/fixtures/401879301/shotmap
